{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39174","headline":"立春 · 韦庄","name":"立春","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"青帝东来日驭迟，煖烟轻逐晓风吹。\n罽袍公子樽前觉，锦帐佳人梦里知。\n雪圃乍开红菜甲，彩幡新翦绿[杨]丝。\n殷勤爲作宜春曲，题向花牋帖绣楣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦庄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39174.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39174","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}